Output images/demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 860
Set Height 480
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 0.5

Type "pip install -U pyseekdb"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "cat images/demo.py"
Sleep 200ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "python3 images/demo.py"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 5s

Sleep 2s
